 "title": "Property of the extended admissible blow-up, [stacks-project]",
 "statement": "The constructed morphism\n$\\mathsf{ExtBl}_{X,W,U}(\\mathcal J)\\to X$ is $U$-admissible, and its\nrestriction to $W$ is canonically the given blow-up\n$\\operatorname{Bl}_{\\mathcal J}(W)\\to W$.",
 "source": {
